</ROW>
</TBODY>
</TGROUP></TABLE></INDICATE>
<HINT>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H334030082A178A09001">Flex lock-up control during acceleration operates in all gears in the D position and in all gears 2 and higher in S mode; flex lock-up control during deceleration operates in 4, 5 and 6.</PTXT></ITEM>
